## Message posting convention

When using the Slack or GitLab MCP server to post a message or comment on the user's behalf, include a robot icon in the message, such as `🤖`.

## Code review comment formatting

When posting review comments on merge requests, do NOT prefix findings with numbered labels like `#1`, `#2`, `[Critical #1]`, etc. Just use the severity tag (e.g. `[Critical]`, `[Warning]`, `[Suggestion]`) followed by a descriptive title.
